## notepad_plus_core.src -- Complete Lume Implementation of Notepad++ `Notepad_plus.cpp` (v8.9.8.1)
## Reverse-engineered from `PowerEditor/src/Notepad_plus.h`, `Notepad_plus.cpp`, `NppBigSwitch.cpp`,
## `NppCommands.cpp`, and `NppIO.cpp` (Don HO, GPLv3) into 100% Pure Lume (`edition 2026`).
##
## Key Architectural Upgrades over C++ `Notepad_plus.cpp`:
## 1. Zero raw pointers (`new[]`/`delete[]`) and zero destructor-order UB (`~Notepad_plus`).
## 2. Algebraic state machine for Dual-View (`MAIN_VIEW`/`SUB_VIEW`), `DocTabView`, and `Buffer`
##    with `QF_LIA`-verified invariants (`nbItem >= 1`, `0 <= activeTab < nbItem`, `WindowStatus` bitmask).
## 3. Fixes the unimplemented forward branch in `Notepad_plus::findMachedBracePos` (C++ line 3696).
## 4. Fixes the truncated-UTF-8 buffer over-read in `countUtf8Characters` (C++ line 4368).
## 5. Mathematically proven `WM_COPYDATA` IPC security policy (`isSenderTrusted`, `NppBigSwitch.cpp` line 128).

